"},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Lisa Schiller hat ihr Heimatdorf Immerstill weit hinter sich gelassen und betreibt einen kleinen Cupcake-Laden in Wien. Als ihre jüngere Schwester Marie und deren Freundin Natalie plötzlich verschwinden, kehrt sie zurück, um auf eigene Faust nach den Vermissten zu suchen. Doch Immerstill macht seinem Namen alle Ehre und noch bevor Lisa mit Hilfe ihres Ex-Freundes, dem Polizisten Patrick, einer richtigen Spur nachgehen kann, wird ein totes Mädchen in den Auen des Flusses Drau gefunden …"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qYAnweKuuLZXnIvPWHTHWd5IBSm.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/91TAjzhEfm2g4MWK0ul3CQl97ol.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1075540,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qYAnweKuuLZXnIvPWHTHWd5IBSm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qYAnweKuuLZXnIvPWHTHWd5IBSm.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qYAnweKuuLZXnIvPWHTHWd5IBSm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qYAnweKuuLZXnIvPWHTHWd5IBSm.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mXgeLmDNHLbA0UJYk2Y9RFTRklm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mXgeLmDNHLbA0UJYk2Y9RFTRklm.jpg","language":"de","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mXgeLmDNHLbA0UJYk2Y9RFTRklm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mXgeLmDNHLbA0UJYk2Y9RFTRklm.jpg","language":"de","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xIZWej9V2zhmAjXPUHaPXz210